{"id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-reflection-principle.md","title":"反射原理 RFN","display":"df-reflection-principle — 反射原理 RFN","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-reflection-principle","aliases":["91-df-reflection-principle","91-df-RFN"],"display":"df-reflection-principle — 反射原理 RFN","depends_on":["[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-reflection-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-reflection-principle</span><span>91-df-RFN</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflection-principle — 反射原理 RFN"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-reflection-principle-—-反射原理-$\\mathrm{RFN}$\">df-reflection-principle — 反射原理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (递归公理化理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的标准可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span> (允许反思的公式类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\\)</span> (自由变量的捕获规避数字代入编码函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\n\\rightarrow\\varphi(\\vec x)\\bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\n\\rightarrow\\varphi(\\vec x)\\bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}\\)</span> : 反射原理（Reflection）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> : 可推导关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>的可证性谓词</li>\n</ul>\n<p>反射原理把元层的可靠性主张按指定公式类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 作为对象层模式加入。必须用可证性谓词表达，不能把元记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(S\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> 直接放进对象语言蕴涵。</p>\n<p>两种形式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>局部反射</strong>：每个句子一个实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>统一反射</strong>：对自由变量统一闭包</li>\n<li><strong>真理化全局反射</strong>：借助真理谓词把所有句子编码压缩为一个全称句</li>\n</ol>\n<p>反射原理的层次：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>局部反射</strong>：对每个句子实例<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>全局反射</strong>：对所有句子概括<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x) \\to T(x))\">\\(\\forall x\\;(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x) \\to T(x))\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理理论的证明能力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅有 UTB 的双条件通常不足以在一个含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的归纳中验证任意 PA 证明；UTB<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^+\">\\(^+\\)</span> 一类带扩展语言归纳的理论才可进行标准的全局声性论证</li>\n<li>保守真理理论不能证明新的纯算术反射结论</li>\n<li>KF、FS 的具体反射强度须从各自公理和归纳原则证明</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与一致性的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>反射原理蕴含一致性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}(S) \\to \\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}(S) \\to \\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span></li>\n<li>反射原理比一致性更强（蕴含更多内容）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-reflection-principle-—-反射原理-$\\mathrm{RFN}$","text":"df-reflection-principle — 反射原理 $\\mathrm{RFN}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}principle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec x))\n\\rightarrow\\varphi(\\vec x)\\bigr)\n\\;\\middle|\\;\n\\varphi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal C\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\to \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x) \\to T(x))","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}(S) \\to \\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false}],"bytes":2298,"backlinks":[{"id":"0bb5ccbcd92bda96","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"846676177c8a9727","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0815358d5b1d8115","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"声性等价于全局反射原则（见[[91-df-reflection-principle]]）："},{"id":"2126873bea8294ae","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt"